@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8787
# Replace with the content of ~/.local/share/agentree/admin-token (or GATEWAY_DATA_DIR/admin-token).
@adminToken = REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_TOKEN
# After registration, paste sessionToken from its response here.
@sessionToken = REPLACE_WITH_SESSION_TOKEN
@workspaceId = REPLACE_WITH_WORKSPACE_ID
@sessionId = REPLACE_WITH_SESSION_ID
@approvalId = REPLACE_WITH_PENDING_APPROVAL_ID
@cursor = 0

### Health check (no credential)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Create workspace (admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Gateway fixture workspace","roots":[]}

### Register a Claude session under a new workspace/branch (admin)
# Registration with cwd will create a workspace and branch when no exact root exists.
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"runtime":"claude-code","cwd":"/tmp/gateway-fixture","label":"fixture-agent"}

### Read workspaces (admin; copy the desired id above)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### List sessions (admin; copy sessionId above)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Ask for a tool decision (session; this waits for an admin decision)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/decide
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"sessionId":"{{sessionId}}","requestId":"fixture-tool-1","tool":"Bash","input":{"command":"echo fixture"},"nativeSessionId":"native-fixture","cwd":"/tmp/gateway-fixture"}

### Inspect pending approvals in another request/tab (admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/approvals
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Approve a pending decision (admin; use its id as approvalId)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/approvals/{{approvalId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"decision":"approved","reason":"fixture approval"}

### Denial alternative (do not run after approving the same approval)
# POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/approvals/{{approvalId}}
# Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
# Content-Type: application/json
#
# {"decision":"denied","reason":"fixture denial"}

### Read workspace event history (admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/events?after=0&limit=100
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Resume global event stream (admin; Last-Event-ID takes precedence over after)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/stream?after={{cursor}}&workspaceId={{workspaceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: text/event-stream

### End session (session-scoped credential)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/sessions/{{sessionId}}/end
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}

### Agent authority check: expected 403 DENY (agent cannot list/approve approvals)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/approvals
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}

### Read current authoritative Main (both native runtimes use their session token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/main
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}

### Write a human expectation directly (use the actual current revision)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/main
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"body":"Keep the public API backward compatible.","expectedRevision":0}

### Inspect branches, activity, proposed work and potential conflicts
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/supervision
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
